      {
        "title": "Smog Dog",
        "text": "One of the 16 CD Player songs. Its melody is on the PSG chip, as in the songs of San Diego, Seattle, Toronto and Chicago. Skitchin' (EA, 1994), Mega Drive / Genesis. Music by Jeff van Dyck."
      },
      {
        "picture": "../_games/skitchin/jeff-van-dyck.png",
        "caption": "Jeff van Dyck"
      },
      {
        "title": "From CD to 8 bits",
        "text": "Jeff wrote the songs on a Mac, with MOTU Performer and CD-quality samples on a SampleCell card. For the cartridge the guitars and drums went down to 11 kHz, mono, 8 bit; here they play at the game's own 11,331 Hz."
      }
